@startuml study-group-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (study-group-service) - FR-19\nOwner: Muhammed Hany Hamdy
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IStudyGroup <<provided>> {
  +createGroup(studentId, name): StudyGroup
  +joinGroup(studentId, code): void
  +shareGoal(groupId, goalId): void
  +postUpdate(groupId, text): void
  +getGroupProgress(groupId): GroupProgress
  +sendMessage(groupId, text): void
  +requestPartner(studentId, partnerId): void
  +respondPartner(requestId, accept): void
}

class StudyGroupService <<component>> {
  -studentProfile: IStudentProfile
  -goal: IGoal
  -analytics: IAnalytics
  -repository: IStudyGroupRepository
  -partnerMatcher: PartnerMatcher
  --
  +createGroup(...) / joinGroup(...)
  +shareGoal(...) / postUpdate(...)
  +getGroupProgress(...) / sendMessage(...)
  +requestPartner(...) / respondPartner(...)
}

IStudyGroup <|.. StudyGroupService
class PartnerMatcher <<component>> {
  +findMatches(studentId): List<String>
}
StudyGroupService --> PartnerMatcher

interface IStudentProfile <<required - Student service>> {
  +createProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +updateProfile(studentId, data): Profile
  +getProfile(studentId): Profile
  +getAvailability(studentId): List<TimeSlot>
}

StudyGroupService --> IStudentProfile
interface IGoal <<required - Academic service>> {
  +createGoal(studentId, data): Goal
  +updateGoal(goalId, data): Goal
  +completeGoal(goalId): void
  +archiveGoal(goalId): void
  +restoreGoal(goalId): void
  +deleteGoal(goalId): void
  +getGoals(studentId, status): List<Goal>
}

StudyGroupService --> IGoal
interface IAnalytics <<required - Analytics service>> {
  +getGoalWorkload(goalId): Workload
  +isOverloaded(goalId): boolean
  +getStudentWorkloads(studentId): List<Workload>
}

StudyGroupService --> IAnalytics
interface IStudyGroupRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: StudyGroup): void
  +findById(id): StudyGroup
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<StudyGroup>
}

StudyGroupService --> IStudyGroupRepository
class StudyGroup {
  -groupId: String
  -name: String
  -inviteCode: String
  -adminId: String
}
class GroupMember {
  -studentId: String
}
class SharedGoal {
  -goalId: String
}
class GroupMessage {
  -senderId: String
  -text: String
  -sentAt: Date
}
class PartnerRequest {
  -requestId: String
  -fromId: String
  -toId: String
  -status: String
}
IStudyGroupRepository --> StudyGroup
StudyGroup *-- "1..*" GroupMember
StudyGroup *-- "0..*" SharedGoal
StudyGroup *-- "0..*" GroupMessage
note bottom of StudyGroupService
SOLID applied:
S - StudyGroupService only coordinates; PartnerMatcher each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing StudyGroupService.
L - StudyGroupService can replace any other IStudyGroup implementation.
I - IStudyGroup has only the operations its clients use.
D - StudyGroupService depends on interfaces (IStudentProfile, IGoal, IAnalytics, IStudyGroupRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
